OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early sunny spells soon
OL,6,Fgiving way to thicker cloud and rain
OL,7,For drizzle, but this clearing around
OL,8,Flate morning. Becoming dry and bright
OL,9,Fwith sunny spells for the afternoon.
OL,10,FBecoming breezy later over the Peak
OL,11,FDistrict.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEarly evening sunny spells
OL,14,Fsoon becoming wet and breezy with
OL,15,Frain, occasionally heavy, moving
OL,16,Fsoutheastwards. Perhaps becoming drier
OL,17,Fin the northwest towards dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
