OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FEarly rain, occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy, clearing away during the first
OL,7,Fhalf of the morning. Then mostly dry
OL,8,Fwith sunny spells, perhaps some
OL,9,Fshowers in the northwest. Wind
OL,10,Fstrengthening.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FSunny
OL,13,Fspells and isolated mainly coastal
OL,14,Fshowers Wednesday, wind easing. Dry
OL,15,Fstart Thursday, but breezy with rain
OL,16,Flater. Early rain Friday clearing.
OL,17,FTemperatures around average for early
OL,18,FSeptember.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
